oss fight in any long solo project is staying motivated. Some days the engine fights you, framerates plummet, and a shader breaks for absolutely no logical reason. But booting up the build on those rough days and watching my wife's characte","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-29T19:40:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165560867","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4819620-1835871199311690","game_id":"steam-4819620","kind":"announcement","title":"Added Endless Run Mode","summary":"​I added an endless run mode where the game gets harder every minute, so far its a lot more fun then a regular game and its more challenging. You must defeat all star difficulties in a world for you to unlock this mode. There is an indicator in the top right of the screen that shows how much stronger the enemies have gotten.​","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-21T22:05:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199311690","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4819620":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:29:59Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:29:59Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4819620":"2026-10-26T14:29:59Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4819620":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:29:59Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:29:59Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:29:59Z"},"4857110":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:29:59Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:29:59Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:29:59Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4819620